      Proof.
        intros nn K Lx mc moc hc X etl crit opd olen op ln q EOC p0 x1 x5 x6 x7 x10 x11 x12 x13 x14 x15 x16 x17 x28 x29 x30 x31
               (B & FR & (XC & XO & PERM) & PPc & Hq) HZ HSUB Hp0 HE Hn HP0.
        binv_open B. pose proof (heap_mok _ _ HI _ _ _ _ HHc) as MK. pose proof LOSP as LOSP'. pose proof alloc_ceiling_pos as ACP.
        pose proof D1x as D1'. pose proof PP1 as PP1'. pose proof PPB as PPB'. pose proof CRB as CRB'. pose proof ALC as ALC'. pose proof ALP as ALP'.
        pose proof B5 as B5'. pose proof B4 as B4'. pose proof BCE as BCE'. pose proof SLO2 as SLO2'. pose proof HLS as HLS'. pose proof CR2x as CR2'. pose proof DHI as DHI'.
        pose proof (proj1 DIMG) as DIM1. pose proof (proj2 DIMG) as DIM2.
        pose proof (unsigned_lit (bv_unsigned sp + -224) ltac:(lia)) as USP.
        unfold FRAME, CONSTS, LOCALS in FR. cbn [app] in FR. xc_open XC.
        zstep. zstep. zstep. zstep.                (* [comment removed for export] *)
        (* [comment removed for export] *)
        pose proof XO as XO0. flat constr:(XO0) 7%nat. flclear XO0. intros _ _ _ _ _ XZ2' _. flat constr:((XZ2' HZ)) 4%nat. intros Zcl Zp Zn Znodes. clear XZ2'.
